```mermaid
flowchart TD
    CMD[User Command Input] --> PARSE[Command Parser]

    PARSE --> CORE{Core Command?}
    PARSE --> STAGE{Stage Command?}
    PARSE --> UTIL{Utility Command?}

    %% Core Commands
    CORE -->|Yes| NEW[/ts-new-project]
    CORE --> STATUS[/ts-status]
    CORE --> APPROVE[/ts-approve]
    CORE --> REVIEW[/ts-review]

    NEW --> FA1[🎩 Founder-Advisor]
    STATUS --> FA1
    APPROVE --> FA1
    REVIEW --> FA1

    %% Stage Commands
    STAGE -->|Yes| ARCH[Architecture Commands]
    STAGE --> PROD[Product Commands]
    STAGE --> DEV[Development Commands]
    STAGE --> REL[Release Commands]
    STAGE --> OPS[Operations Commands]

    ARCH --> SA[🏗️ Solution Architect]
    PROD --> PL[👔 Product Lead]
    PROD --> PP[📅 Project Planner]
    PROD --> BA[💼 Business Analyst]

    DEV --> PD[👨‍💼 Principal Developer]
    DEV --> QA[🧪 QA Engineer]
    DEV --> DB[🗄️ Database Developer]
    DEV --> BE[⚙️ Backend Developer]
    DEV --> FE[🎨 Frontend Developer]
    DEV --> IE[🔗 Integration Engineer]

    REL --> TW[📝 Technical Writer]
    REL --> SE[🔐 Security Engineer]
    REL --> RE[📦 Release Engineer]
    REL --> DE[🚀 DevOps Engineer]

    OPS --> SRE1[🚀 SRE Deploy Engineer]
    OPS --> SRE2[🛡️ SRE Ops Engineer]

    %% Utility Commands
    UTIL -->|Yes| BF[🐛 Bug Fixer]
    UTIL --> HELP[Help System]
    UTIL --> VERIFY[Verification Tools]

    %% All agents interact with project file
    FA1 --> PF[📋 Project File]
    SA --> PF
    PL --> PF
    PP --> PF
    BA --> PF
    PD --> PF
    QA --> PF
    DB --> PF
    BE --> PF
    FE --> PF
    IE --> PF
    TW --> PF
    SE --> PF
    RE --> PF
    DE --> PF
    SRE1 --> PF
    SRE2 --> PF
    BF --> PF

    %% Output back to user
    PF --> OUTPUT[Command Result]
    OUTPUT --> USER[👤 User Response]

    %% Error handling
    PARSE --> ERROR{Parse Error?}
    ERROR -->|Yes| HELP_MSG[Show Help Message]
    ERROR -->|No| EXEC[Execute Command]

    %% State validation
    EXEC --> VALIDATE[Validate Project State]
    VALIDATE --> PREREQ{Prerequisites Met?}
    PREREQ -->|No| PREREQ_ERROR[Show Prerequisites]
    PREREQ -->|Yes| AGENT_EXEC[Execute Agent]

    %% Style classes
    classDef command fill:#FFE4B5,stroke:#D2691E,stroke-width:2px
    classDef agent fill:#F0FFF0,stroke:#32CD32,stroke-width:1px
    classDef system fill:#E6F3FF,stroke:#4169E1,stroke-width:2px
    classDef error fill:#FFE4E1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px

    class CMD,NEW,STATUS,APPROVE,REVIEW command
    class SA,PL,PP,BA,PD,QA,DB,BE,FE,IE,TW,SE,RE,DE,SRE1,SRE2,BF agent
    class PF,PARSE,EXEC,VALIDATE system
    class ERROR,PREREQ_ERROR,HELP_MSG error
```